From: Vitaly Lipatov <lav@etersoft.ru>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:02:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 54/58] soc: qcom: connect firmware-described ADSP and APR
 services

Record the existing TCL ACPI audio integration source. Hardware playback has been observed during development; this source snapshot still requires a complete rebuild and lifecycle regression validation.
---
 drivers/remoteproc/qcom_common.c   |   6 ++
 drivers/remoteproc/qcom_q6v5_pas.c |  19 ++++
 drivers/remoteproc/qcom_sysmon.c   |   4 +
